msgid "First, let's set a rally point. Setting a rally point on a building that can train units will automatically designate a task to the new unit upon completion of training. We want to send the newly trained units to gather wood on the group of trees to the south of the Civic Center. To do so, select the Civic Center by clicking on it and then right-click on one of the trees.\n"
