msgid "Ngorongoro Crater is the world's largest intact volcanic caldera and is one of the Seven Natural Wonders of Africa. Due to it's climate, biodiversity and history, Ngorongoro is believed by some to be Africa's Garden of Eden and the birthplace of mankind."
