msgid "TempleOfMars"
msgstr "마르스 신전"

msgid "TempleOfVesta"
msgstr "베스타신전"

msgid "Temples and Wonder −50% stone cost and build time."
msgstr "사원및 불가사의의 석재 비용 및 건설 시간이 -50% 감소합니다."

msgid "Temples −50% resource costs and build time. Temple technologies −50% resource costs and research time."
